<div id="Content">
	<div class="content_wrapper clearfix">

		<!-- .sections_group -->
		<div class="sections_group">
		
			<div class="entry-content" itemprop="mainContentOfPage">
			
				<div class="section mcb-section   "  style="padding-top:100px; padding-bottom:0px; background-color:#ffffff" ><div class="section_wrapper mcb-section-inner"><div class="wrap mcb-wrap one  valign-top clearfix" style="" ><div class="mcb-wrap-inner"><div class="column mcb-column one-sixth column_placeholder"><div class="placeholder">&nbsp;</div></div><div class="column mcb-column one-third column_column  column-margin-"><div class="column_attr clearfix"  style=""><div id="jet">
<img class="scale-with-grid" src="https://www.jet-contractors.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/07/logo_r.png" alt="L'alliage des savoir-faire®" />
</div>
<p>TCE - Enveloppes de bâtiments - Constructions métalliques<br />
Ouvrages d’art - Ossature bois - EPC solaire...</p>
<hr class="no_line" style="margin: 0 auto 15px;"/>

<div class="image_frame image_item no_link scale-with-grid alignnone no_border" ><div class="image_wrapper"><img class="scale-with-grid" src="http://www.jet-contractors.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/08/home_builder_sep.png" alt=""   /></div></div>
</div></div><div class="column mcb-column one-third column_column  column-margin-"><div class="column_attr clearfix align_justify"  style=""><h5 style="font-weight: 700; color: #071323;">Fondé en 1992 par Mohamed Adil Rtabi, son président actuel, le groupe Jet Contractors coté, depuis 2011, à la bourse des valeurs de Casablanca, a développé au fil des années, à travers ses filiales et ses unités de production industrielle, un modèle d’affaires conjuguant le meilleur de l’industrie au meilleur de la construction.</h5>
<br />
<h5>Le groupe a ainsi intégré l’essentiel de la chaine de valeur pour devenir l’acteur national de référence en matière de réalisation « clé en main » de bâtiments à forte composante architecturale.
<br />
L’originalité du modèle Jet Contractors tient à l’alliage de la compétence du general contracting, intégrant l’engineering d’execution, à celle de métier d’industriel intégré via des sites de production de plus de 120 000 m² organisés en neuf unités industrielles.</h5>


<hr class="no_line" style="margin: 0 auto 15px;"/>


<div id="jet"><a class="mfn-link mfn-link-2 " href="http://www.jet-contractors.com/entreprise/" data-hover="En savoir plus" ontouchstart="this.classList.toggle('hover');"  ><span data-hover="En savoir plus">En savoir plus</span></a></div></div></div><div class="column mcb-column one-sixth column_placeholder"><div class="placeholder">&nbsp;</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="section mcb-section  full-width "  style="padding-top:20px; padding-bottom:0px; background-color:#e5e5e5" ><div class="section_wrapper mcb-section-inner"><div class="wrap mcb-wrap one  valign-middle clearfix" style="" ><div class="mcb-wrap-inner"><div class="column mcb-column one column_column  column-margin-"><div class="column_attr clearfix align_left"  style=" padding:20px;"><h2>DOMAINES D'INTERVENTION</h2>

</div></div><div class="column mcb-column one-fourth column_zoom_box "><div class="zoom_box"><a href="http://www.jet-contractors.com/general-contracting/" ><div class="photo"><img class="scale-with-grid" src="http://www.jet-contractors.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/07/A1.jpg" alt="" width="" height=""/></div><div class="desc" style="background-color:rgba(17, 35, 49, 0.8);"><div class="desc_wrap"><div class="desc_img"><img class="scale-with-grid" src="http://www.jet-contractors.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/07/ICO-GC.png" alt="" width="" height=""/></div><div class="desc_txt">General Contracting</div></div></div></a></div>
</div><div class="column mcb-column one-fourth column_zoom_box "><div class="zoom_box"><a href="http://www.jet-contractors.com/enveloppes-de-batiments/" ><div class="photo"><img class="scale-with-grid" src="https://www.jet-contractors.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/05/CFC.jpg" alt="CFC" width="400" height="480"/></div><div class="desc" style="background-color:rgba(17, 35, 49, 0.8);"><div class="desc_wrap"><div class="desc_img"><img class="scale-with-grid" src="http://www.jet-contractors.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/07/ICO-EB.png" alt="" width="" height=""/></div><div class="desc_txt">Enveloppes de Bâtiments</div></div></div></a></div>
</div><div class="column mcb-column one-fourth column_zoom_box "><div class="zoom_box"><a href="http://www.jet-contractors.com/charpentes-bois-et-metalliques/" ><div class="photo"><img class="scale-with-grid" src="http://jet-contractors.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/07/A2.jpg" alt="" width="" height=""/></div><div class="desc" style="background-color:rgba(17, 35, 49, 0.8);"><div class="desc_wrap"><div class="desc_img"><img class="scale-with-grid" src="http://www.jet-contractors.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/07/ICO-CB.png" alt="" width="" height=""/></div><div class="desc_txt">Charpentes Bois & Métalliques</div></div></div></a></div>
</div><div class="column mcb-column one-fourth column_zoom_box "><div class="zoom_box"><a href="http://www.jet-contractors.com/epc-solaire/" ><div class="photo"><img class="scale-with-grid" src="http://www.jet-contractors.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/07/METIER50-1.jpg" alt="" width="" height=""/></div><div class="desc" style="background-color:rgba(17, 35, 49, 0.8);"><div class="desc_wrap"><div class="desc_img"><img class="scale-with-grid" src="http://www.jet-contractors.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/07/ICO-EPC.png" alt="" width="" height=""/></div><div class="desc_txt">EPC Solaire</div></div></div></a></div>
</div></div></div></div></div><div class="section mcb-section   "  style="padding-top:30px; padding-bottom:0px; background-color:" ><div class="section_wrapper mcb-section-inner"><div class="wrap mcb-wrap one  valign-top clearfix" style="" ><div class="mcb-wrap-inner"><div class="column mcb-column one-sixth column_placeholder"><div class="placeholder">&nbsp;</div></div><div class="column mcb-column two-third column_column  column-margin-"><div class="column_attr clearfix align_justify"  style=""><h2>UN GROUPE INDUSTRIEL ET OPERATIONNEL INTÉGRÉ</h2>

<h5>S'appuyant sur plus de 8 000 collaborateurs répartis dans 15 filiales au Maroc et à l'international, le Groupe Jet Contractors dispose de plusieurs sites industriels majeurs situés près de Skhirat, le long de l’axe stratégique Rabat-Casablanca. Ces sites rassemblent, par segment, les activités d’entreprise générale (ingénierie, achats et pilotage), de manufacturing ainsi que la gestion du matériel de chantier.

</h5></div></div><div class="column mcb-column one-sixth column_placeholder"><div class="placeholder">&nbsp;</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="section mcb-section no-margin-h  hide-desktop hide-tablet"  style="padding-top:10px; padding-bottom:50px; background-color:" ><div class="section_wrapper mcb-section-inner"><div class="wrap mcb-wrap one no-margin column-margin-0px valign-middle clearfix" style="" ><div class="mcb-wrap-inner"><div class="column mcb-column one column_hover_box "><div class="hover_box"><a href="http://www.jet-contractors.com/bureau-detudes/" ><div class="hover_box_wrapper"><img class="visible_photo scale-with-grid" src="http://www.jet-contractors.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/07/schema_be_h.png" alt="" width="" height=""/><img class="hidden_photo scale-with-grid" src="http://www.jet-contractors.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/07/schema_be.png" alt="" width="" height=""/></div></a></div>
